--TEST--
reading an enum case highlights the case's own name, the enum written in front of it being a use of the enum and no use of the case, `rule:ide/five-features-are-one-reference-index`
--FILE--
<?nvs
enum Status: int
{
    case Draft = 1;
    case Live = 2;
}

var $s = Status::Dra<|>ft;
--REQUEST--
documentHighlight
--EXPECT--
case.nvs:8:18
